        "body": "<p>Like many pet parents, we wanted food we could trust. What began as a personal search for better nutrition eventually led us to develop some of the first air-dried recipes of their kind, publish a book on canine nutrition, build relationships with trusted farmers, ranchers, and fishermen, and serve millions of meals to dogs through better food.</p>",
